story('chris-paul', 'The Chris Paul trail', 'One point guard.\nA league of echoes.',
      'From Lob City to a draft obligation that reaches Dallas. Follow Paul, then follow what travels the other way.',
      'Modern', 2011, 2026, 'LAC', '#96a2f3',
      'paul-clippers rivers-draft paul-houston paul-westbrook paul-phoenix beal-phoenix paul-warriors topic-draft peavy-draft mccollum-washington trae-wizards davis-wizards',
      'paul-clippers', 'Paul’s completed 2011, 2017, 2019, 2020 and two 2023 trades; selected Rivers, Topić, Peavy, Poole and draft-asset branches through February 2026. Paul’s later free agency and untraced draft outcomes are excluded.',
      'A single career can connect very different packages. The players and picks received alongside each other remain separate paths.')
story('lob-city', 'The other side of Lob City', 'Follow the return.\nFind another blockbuster.',
      'Beverley reaches the Gobert package. Houston’s first reaches Golden State. Both begin in the same Clippers return.',
      'Modern', 2017, 2023, 'LAC', '#96a2f3',
      'hilliard-houston liggins-houston paul-houston gallinari-clippers spellman-draft spellman-warriors russell-minnesota kuminga-draft beverley-memphis beverley-minnesota gobert-minnesota beverley-lakers keyonte-draft',
      'paul-houston', 'Two traced branches of the 2017 Paul package: the Houston first through Spellman and the Russell–Wiggins exchange; Beverley through Minnesota and the Gobert package. Stops at the 2023 draft. Other players and subsequent moves are outside the route.',
      'The least famous pieces can reveal the longest connections. A later package still includes contributions from several assets.')
story('westbrook', 'The Westbrook exchange', 'Two point guards.\nYears of consequences.',
      'Houston and Oklahoma City exchange stars. The picks, and Paul’s next trades, keep the story moving.',
      'Modern', 2019, 2026, 'OKC', '#77b8f9',
      'paul-westbrook paul-phoenix westbrook-washington beal-phoenix paul-warriors topic-draft peavy-draft mccollum-washington trae-wizards davis-wizards',
      'paul-westbrook', 'The 2019 exchange, Westbrook’s 2020 Washington move, Topić’s 2024 selection and Paul-return branches through February 2026. Westbrook’s Lakers arrival and subsequent career are outside this route. Original future-pick terms are recorded; untraced outcomes are not current holdings.',
      'An exchange of stars can leave several independent trails. The Houston first and the Paul package have different afterlives.')
story('durant', 'What Durant left behind', 'A goodbye.\nSeveral new beginnings.',
      'Russell’s package brings Wiggins and a pick. Johnson’s next move brings a first seven years away.',
      'Modern', 2019, 2025, 'GSW', '#efcd64',
      'durant-brooklyn russell-minnesota kuminga-draft durant-phoenix russell-lakers butler-warriors johnson-denver',
      'durant-brooklyn', 'Durant’s 2019 sign-and-trade and 2023 Phoenix package; selected Russell, Wiggins, Kuminga and Cameron Johnson branches through July 2025. Durant’s 2025 Houston deal, the Bridges branch and remaining pick outcomes are not traced. Later player movement is not implied absent.',
      'The 2020 return belongs to the Russell–Spellman–Evans package. Durant’s departure connects to that package without becoming its sole cause.')
story('gobert', 'The Gobert package', 'One center.\nSeveral futures.',
      'Utah receives players, draft rights and obligations. Follow the routes that separate almost immediately.',
      'Modern', 2021, 2023, 'UTA', '#aea0f3',
      'beverley-memphis beverley-minnesota gobert-minnesota beverley-lakers russell-lakers keyonte-draft',
      'gobert-minnesota', 'Beverley’s 2021 route into Minnesota, the complete July 2022 Gobert transaction, Beverley’s Lakers move, the February 2023 three-team package and the Keyonte George selection. Later Utah pick pooling, trades and conveyances are outside this story.',
      'Four future firsts, one swap and an already-drafted player are different assets. Beasley and Vanderbilt later join a package with other contributions.')
